,"num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-12-11T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"noUhLaU3W","title":"The Swedbank Outage shows that Change Controls don't work","url":"http://highscalability.com/blog/2023/8/16/the-swedbank-outage-shows-that-change-controls-dont-work.html","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-swedbank-outage-shows-that-change-controls-don-t-work-nouhlau3w","summary":"A major outage at Swedbank caused by an unapproved change to their IT systems highlights the ineffectiveness of change controls and the need for better risk management in technology organizations.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/1ecc6a0fec00d2e160f56a0cd8fa1c2a?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-08-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"gc20jflvi","title":"Gossip Protocol Explained","url":"http://highscalability.com/blog/2023/7/16/gossip-protocol-explained.html","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/gossip-protocol-explained-gc20jflvi","summary":"Gossip Protocol Explained - High Scalability - Gossip protocol Explained You can subscribe to the system design newsletter to excel in system design interviews and software architecture. The gossip protocol algorithms can be used to implement peer-to-peer state management services with high scalability and improved resilience.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f5ab6671a6b31638b77208f5eab238cc?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":5,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2023-07-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"22Dpekjln","title":"Lessons Learned Running Presto at Meta Scale","url":"http://highscalability.com/blog/2023/7/16/lessons-learned-running-presto-at-meta-scale.html","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/lessons-learned-running-presto-at-meta-scale-22dpekjln","summary":"A new version of Presto at Meta Scale Presto is built and ready for deployment roughly once, and sometimes twice, each month. We\u2019ve been using it at Meta for the past ten years, and learned a lot while doing so.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/48da2236cafbf5f1b896a7b9da9c4881?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-07-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"GprjgaSut","title":"Consistent hashing algorithm","url":"http://highscalability.com/blog/2023/2/22/consistent-hashing-algorithm.html","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/consistent-hashing-algorithm-gprjgasut","summary":"Consistent hashing algorithm - High Scalability - Consistent hash algorithm. The output of the hash function is placed on a virtual ring structure (known as the hash ring) The hash ring is traversed in the clockwise direction starting from the position of the key.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c3785aebc2be7ce055b08c01447c14c6","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-02-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"3GKABPAZO","title":"What is Cloud Computing? According to ChatGPT.","url":"http://highscalability.com/blog/2022/12/16/what-is-cloud-computing-according-to-chatgpt.html","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-is-cloud-computing-according-to-chatgpt--3gkabpazo","summary":"ChatGPT: What is Cloud Computing? According toChatGPT, it's a model of computing that delivers computing services over the internet. It allows users to access and use shared computing resources, such as servers, storage, and applications, on demand and without the need to manage the underlying infrastructure.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/e9443ad54a4e54918d603c0728a74182","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-12-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"sFmWcyTE4","title":"Stuff The Internet Says On Scalability For December 2nd, 2022","url":"http://highscalability.com/blog/2022/12/2/stuff-the-internet-says-on-scalability-for-december-2nd-2022.html","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/stuff-the-internet-says-on-scalability-for-december-2nd-2022-sfmwcyte4","summary":"The new version of Explain the Cloud Like I'm 10 adds 2x more coverage of AWS, Azure, GCP, and K8s. It has 482 mostly 5 star reviews on Amazon. 1.5 billion fields per second across 3000 different data types served by Twitter's GraphQL API.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/ef1d17d1e57780edf577195c8a8f94d5","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-12-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"s4c3wqzaG","title":"An Argument Against the Vertical Separation of Cloud Providers","url":"http://highscalability.com/blog/2022/10/24/the-cloud-is-not-a-railroad-an-argument-against-the-vertical.html","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/an-argument-against-the-vertical-separation-of-cloud-providers-s4c3wqzag","summary":"A move to regulate cloud providers by vertically separating the services they offer would be new to the cloud industry. Cory Doctorow: The Cloud is not a monopoly, it's still a child or maybe a pre-teen in terms of the overall IT industry.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/cb16be3cf80fe75dca95ca8e078207f9","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"b5xJ2usiI","title":"Announcing: A Completely New and Updated Version of Explain the Cloud Like I'm 10","url":"http://highscalability.com/blog/2022/10/7/announcing-a-completely-new-and-updated-version-of-explain-t.html","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/announcing-a-completely-new-and-updated-version-of-explain-the-cloud-like-i-m-10-b5xj2usii","summary":"A Completely New and Updated Version of Explain the Cloud Like I'm 10 is now available for free. You can buy version 2.0 at: https://www.amazon.com/Explain-Cloud-Like-Im-10-ebook/B0765C4SNR.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/cc8b8b8283b195c2a2159b2c68722e20","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"xV3vd1bIf","title":"Spo